puls-diskinfo (1.1.4) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Direct unprivileged hwmon drive temperature monitoring without root privileges
  * PCIe link speed, width, and generation negotiation inspector (PCIe Gen 1-6)
  * USB speed version categorization (USB 2.0 to USB4) and bridge chip identification
  * Enhanced partition & multi-layer device-mapper (LUKS/LVM) mapping
  * Dual storage capacity formatters (Decimal SI vs Binary IEC) with user preference toggle
  * Rich hardware parameters populated in headless CLI and JSON telemetry modes

